  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd the missing Gate map to the rotated WCS control suite.\nPin suite selection for commands, operation generation, posting, and stock simulation changes.\nRecord the decision in the issue ledger.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe suite header had no Gate map.\nThe missing-map law failed, and the quick gate could omit the suite for source changes.\n\n## Tests\n\nThe new pin is gate_maps_tests::wcs_rotation_control_is_selected_for_its_app_entry_points.\nIt failed before the fix and passed after the fix.\nRestoring the upstream header made it fail again.\nRestoring the fixed header made it pass again.\nAll xtask tests pass, including no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app.\n\nThe quick gate passes with upstream/main as its base.\nAll four WCS control tests pass.\nClippy passes for xtask and camcraft-app with all targets and warnings denied.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. The diff contains no changed .nc or .cl files.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo manual GUI or machine run. The change adds test metadata and a selection test.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. No open PR changed the three planned files at the overlap check.\n\nProcess change: yes\nEffort: low\nChangelog: Restore the rotated WCS control suite gate map and pin its quick-gate selection.\n\nFixes #2361\n",
